## 🚀 Featured Project

### X-ARCH Theme Studio

A Linux icon theme manager built with **Python, GTK4, and Rust**.

**Project goals:**
- Manage and preview Linux icon themes.
- Customize individual folder icons.
- Import icon theme packages.
- Back up and restore configuration changes.
- Support KDE Plasma and Hyprland workflows.

🔗 [Explore X-ARCH Theme Studio](https://github.com/runningwithrottweilers/xarch-theme-studio)

